  "remarks": "Pursuant to paragraph 6 of Security Council Resolution 2371 (2017), paragraph 6 of Security Council Resolution 2375 (2017)and paragraph 12 of Security Council resolution 2321 (2016). In late November 2017 the YU PHYONG 5 conducted a ship-to-ship transfer of 1,721 metric tons of fuel oil. Listed as asset of Korea Myongdok Shipping Co - OFSI ID: 13634. UN Reference Number: UN Ref KPe.063",
